<title>USA: Oneida Ltd Q3 Oct 26 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Oneida Ltd Q3 Oct 26 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ONEIDA, N.Y. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.47		    $0.42</p>
<p> Oper net		    5,306		    4,740</p>
<p> Revs			101,280		  100,627</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>			 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.98		    $0.90</p>
<p> Oper net		   10.929		   10,002</p>
<p> Revs			270,477		  270,275</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results exclude Camden Wire results, which are regarded as discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q3 periods exclude a charge of $1.0 million in 1996 and a gain of $605,000 in 1995 from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Nine month periods exclude a charge of $1.2 million in 1996 and a gain of $2.2 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Q3 net income including discontinued operations was $4.3 million vs $5.3 million.</p>
<p>Nine month net income including discontinued operations was $9.7 million vs $12.2 million.</p>
</text>
